{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-luk-8-1","title":"Luke 8:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Women minister unto Christ of their substance. 4 Christ, after he had preached from place to place, attended by his apostles, propounds the parable of the sower, 16 and the candle; 19 declares who are his mother, and brethren; 22 rebukes the winds; 26 casts the legion of devils out of the man into the herd of swine; 37 is rejected of the Gadarenes,; 43 heals the woman of her bloody issue; 49 and raises from death Jairus's daughter.</p>\n<p>that. 4:43,44; Mt 4:23; 9:35; 11:1; Mr 1:39; Ac 10:38 the glad. 2:10,11; 4:18; Isa 61:1-3; Mt 13:19; Ac 13:32; Ro 10:15 and the. 6:14-16; Mt 10:2-4; Mr 3:16-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-8-2","title":"Luke 8:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>certain. 23:27; Mt 27:55,56; Mr 15:40,41; 16:1; Joh 19:25; Ac 1:14 out. 30; Mr 16:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-8-3","title":"Luke 8:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Joanna. 24:10 Herod's. 9:7-9; Joh 4:46-53; Ac 13:1; Php 4:22 of their. 1Ch 29:14; Isa 23:18; Mt 2:11; 25:40; 26:11; Ac 9:36-39; 2Co 8:9 1Ti 5:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-8-4","title":"Luke 8:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Mt 13:2; Mr 4:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-8-5","title":"Luke 8:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>sower. 11; Mt 13:3,4,18,19,24-26,37; Mr 4:2-4,15,26-29 fell. 12; Heb 2:1; Jas 1:23,24 it. Ps 119:118; Mt 5:13 and the. Ge 15:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-8-6","title":"Luke 8:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":8